            "latex": "W_{\\text{总}} = F s = \\frac{G_{\\text{物}} + G_{\\text{动}}}{n} \\cdot n h = G_{\\text{物}} h + G_{\\text{动}} h",
            "note": "绳子段数 n 自动约去，体现功的原理：省力必然费距离",
            "cited_formula_ids": [
